152 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(As we embark on this exciting journey with R.S.I.C, we would be honored by your school's participation and look forward to witnessing the exceptional talent, passion, and ingenuity of your students. Together, let us make this a memorable celebration of curiosity, innovation, and the spirit of scientific inquiry.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[8]>>
