155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 77 0 R/E(It gives me great pleasure to welcome you all to the Ravi Science and Innovation Competition \(RSIC\), the first science and innovation event of its kind at The City School Ravi Campus.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 77 0 R/E(What makes RSIC particularly special is that it has been brought to life by our own students. Seeing their idea grow into an event that brings together young minds from different schools is a matter of great pride for me. Their enthusiasm, commitment, and willingness to take on something new have been truly encouraging.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

157 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 77 0 R/E(RSIC is not only about competition. It is about giving students the opportunity to think beyond the classroom, explore new ideas, work together, and learn from one another. I hope that every delegate who joins us takes away something meaningful from the experience, whether it is a new idea, a new perspective, or simply the confidence to think differently. I am delighted to welcome all our participating schools and delegates to Ravi Campus and look forward to seeing the energy, creativity, and enthusiasm that each of you brings to RSIC.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

