166 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 79 0 R/E(An idea, a vision, and a whole lot of hard work later, RSIC is finally here! A year in the making, countless meetings, 2 AM work sessions, a few collective crash-outs, and more than a handful of strikes later, what once seemed like an idea has finally become a reality. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

167 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 79 0 R/E(Somewhere along the way, though, the planning became its own little reality show. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

168 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 79 0 R/E(From Sabika\220s irreverent daily quotes to Khadija\220s constant rants, from Ilma\220s crash-outs to Alizah and Zayna\220s tea-dropping sessions, and from Meerab\220s occasional disappearances to Laveazay making sure to call her out every chance she got, and Hussain surviving as the only guy in the E.C. the Executive Council has had its fair share of plot twists. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

169 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 79 0 R/E(At this point, organising RSIC has been just as much about keeping up with the EC as it has been about organising the event itself. But between the chaos, the laughter, the last-minute changes, and the endless meetings, one thing has remained constant: our excitement to bring this vision to life. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

