endobj

173 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 80 0 R/T(Three days of science, innovation, curiosity, and a little healthy competition await, and we cannot wait to see what you all bring to the table. To all our delegates, thank you for being a part of this milestone.)/E(Three days of science, innovation, curiosity, and a little healthy competition await, and we cannot wait to see what you all bring to the table. To all our delegates, thank you for being a part of this milestone.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

174 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 80 0 R/T(We hope you bring your curiosity, your competitive spirit, and perhaps a little patience for the unexpected. After all, if the Executive Council has taught us anything, it is that things rarely go exactly as planned, but they do make for a good story. The Executive Council may have been a whole event in itself, but now it is your turn to take the centre stage.)/E(We hope you bring your curiosity, your competitive spirit, and perhaps a little patience for the unexpected. After all, if the Executive Council has taught us anything, it is that things rarely go exactly as planned, but they do make for a good story. The Executive Council may have been a whole event in itself, but now it is your turn to take the centre stage.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

